# Coffee Shop Landing Page

## Project Overview

This is a simple Coffee Shop Landing Page created using HTML and CSS. The website presents a coffee shop with a clean and user-friendly design. It includes sections such as Home, About Us, Menu, Contact Information, and Footer.

The project was developed to practice basic front-end web development concepts including page structure, styling, layouts, and responsive design.

## Features

* Responsive navigation bar
* Hero section with call-to-action button
* About Us section
* Coffee menu cards
* Contact information section
* Footer section
* Basic hover effects
* Mobile-friendly layout

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3

## Project Structure

```text
Coffee-Shop-Landing-Page/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
```

## How to Run the Project

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Double-click `index.html` or open it in any web browser.

